.env
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
# Committed SEC Open Data cache (mirrors ../Backtest Portfolio Webull:SEC
# OPENAI's data/sec/ pattern of committing its NAV cache) -- the app reads
# these directly at request time instead of calling the live SEC API,
# which is slow/flaky. See CLAUDE.md's Data flow section.
!data/processed/fund_universe.csv
!data/processed/nav_panel.parquet
